<title>UK: CCCI sets $750 million seven-year FRN.</title>
<headline>CCCI sets $750 million seven-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate notes issue was announced by joint lead managers Credit Suisse First Boston and Paribas.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CAISSE CENTRALE DU CREDIT IMMOBILIER</p>
<p> AMT	  $750 MLN  BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	*JUN.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +5 BP     PAY DATE    27.JUN.97</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   ISS PRICE  99.825    FULL FEES   0.175</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 REOFFER    99.825</p>
<p> NOTES     *INVESTOR PUT AT PAR AFTER FIVE YEARS.</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX/HK/SI DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS **</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  FRANCE    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.075     SELL CONC  0.10	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> NOTES    **US/GB/FR/HK/SI</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
